\u20316?\u26426?\u21046?\u12290?\u27605?\u19994?\u29983?\u23601?\u19994?\u21435?\u21521?\u20026?\u22823?\u22411?\u22806?\u20225?\u12289?\u27773?\u-28826?\u31561?\u22823?\u22411?\u21046?\u-28640?\u19994?\u12289?\u22823?\u22411?\u-28646?\u-29777?\u31867?\u20225?\u19994?\u12289?\u22823?\u22411?\u19987?\u19994?\u-29762?\u-29791?\u20844?\u21496?\u12289?\u20013?\u23567?\u22411?\u-29762?\u-29791?\u20844?\u21496?\u21450?\u-32278?\u20027?\u21019?\u19994?\u12290?\f3\fs18\cf0 The\u160?\cell \trowd\trftsWidth3\trwWidth14609\trrh-1340\trgaph10\trpaddl0\trpaddr0\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3\clvmgf\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth14599\cellx14599\row\trowd\trftsWidth3\trwWidth14609\trrh-1340\trgaph10\trpaddl0\trpaddr0\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3\clvmrg\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth14599\cellx14599\pard\intbl\cell \trowd\trftsWidth3\trwWidth14609\trrh-1340\trgaph10\trpaddl0\trpaddr0\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3\clvmrg\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth14599\cellx14599\row\trowd\trftsWidth3\trwWidth14609\trrh-2540\trgaph10\trpaddl0\trpaddr0\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth14599\cellx14599\pard\plain\intbl\s0\ql\fi0\li0\ri0\plain\f3\fs18\cf0 discipline of design was first established in 1986 suggested by Qian Xuesen, starting to enroll graduate students from 1999, one of the very first in China. In 2015, it set up "Design Science and Engineering" cross-doctoral program. The School of Design was established in December 2017, and included in the school's "double first-class" key construction of one of the 17 subject groups; in 2018, the independent design-level doctoral program was added. As for QS World University Rankings, it has entered the Global Top 50 of Art &Design for two consecutive years from 2015.\f3\fs18\cf2 This discipline is based on the strong advantages of the comprehensiveness of Shanghai Jiao Tong University, focusing on the integration of science and art, and emphasizing multi-disciplinary innovation design. It cultivates talented design professionals imbued with concern for our common human destiny, dedicated to providing solutions for the development of humanity. \f3\fs18\cf0 Under the discipline, there are three frontier research directions including Intelligent Design Theory and Method, Information and Interaction Design, Environment and Sustainable Design. \f3\fs18\cf2 At present, there are 26 master supervisors, including 8 professors and 15 associate professors, more than 60 percetage of whom has ph.d degrees, consisting of its strong teaching resources and rigorous academic attitude.\f3\fs18\cf0 This discipline has cooperated with many domestic companies to develop projects, and has achieved fruitful results. It has established extensive academic exchange relationships with many internationally renowned design schools, and formed a cooperative mechanism for talent training and scientific research. Graduates and alumni tend to work in large multinatinal companies, large manufacturing industries such as automobiles, large communications companies, large professional design companies, small and medium-sized design companies, and independent entrepreneurship\cell \trowd\trftsWidth3\trwWidth14609\trrh-2540\trgaph10\trpaddl0\trpaddr0\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth14599\cellx14599\row\pard\plain\sl0\plain\fs2\page\pard\plain\sl0\plain\fs2\par\trowd\trftsWidth3\trwWidth14609\trrh-2540\trgaph10\trpaddl0\trpaddr0\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth14599\cellx14599\pard\plain\intbl\s0\ql\fi0\li0\ri0\plain\f3\fs18\cf0 discipline of design was first established in 1986 suggested by Qian Xuesen, starting to enroll graduate students from 1999, one of the very first in China. In 2015, it set up "Design Science and Engineering" cross-doctoral program. The School of Design was established in December 2017, and included in the school's "double first-class" key construction of one of the 17 subject groups; in 2018, the independent design-level doctoral program was added. As for QS World University Rankings, it has entered the Global Top 50 of Art &Design for two consecutive years from 2015.\f3\fs18\cf2 This discipline is based on the strong advantages of the comprehensiveness of Shanghai Jiao Tong University, focusing on the integration of science and art, and emphasizing multi-disciplinary innovation design. It cultivates talented design professionals imbued with concern for our common human destiny, dedicated to providing solutions for the development of humanity. \f3\fs18\cf0 Under the discipline, there are three frontier research directions including Intelligent Design Theory and Method, Information and Interaction Design, Environment and Sustainable Design. \f3\fs18\cf2 At present, there are 26 master supervisors, including 8 professors and 15 associate professors, more than 60 percetage of whom has ph.d degrees, consisting of its strong teaching resources and rigorous academic attitude.\f3\fs18\cf0 This discipline has cooperated with many domestic companies to develop projects, and has achieved fruitful results. It has established extensive academic exchange relationships with many internationally renowned design schools, and formed a cooperative mechanism for talent training and scientific research. Graduates and alumni tend to work in large multinatinal companies, large manufacturing industries such as automobiles, large communications companies, large professional design companies, small and medium-sized design companies, and independent entrepreneurship\cell \trowd\trftsWidth3\trwWidth14609\trrh-2540\trgaph10\trpaddl0\trpaddr0\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth14599\cellx14599\row\trowd\trftsWidth3\trwWidth14609\trrh-500\trgaph10\trpaddl0\trpaddr0\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth12441\cellx12441\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth824\cellx13265\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth1334\cellx14599\pard\plain\intbl\s0\ql\fi0\li20\ri0\sl-312\plain\f1\fs26\b\cf0 \u19977?\u12289?\u22521?\u20859?\u30446?\u26631? Program Objective\b0\cell\pard\plain\intbl\s0\fi0\li0\ri0\plain\cell\pard\plain\intbl\s0\fi0\li0\ri0\plain\cell \trowd\trftsWidth3\trwWidth14609\trrh-500\trgaph10\trpaddl0\trpaddr0\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth12441\cellx12441\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth824\cellx13265\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth1334\cellx14599\row\trowd\trftsWidth3\trw