0851?\u20135?\u19994?\u-26490?\u22495?\u-29762?\u-29791?\u12289?\u21046?\u-28640?\u20197?\u21450?\u31649?\u29702?\u31561?\u29702?\u-29766?\u19982?\u24037?\u31243?\u25216?\u26415?\u24212?\u29992?\u-27154?\u-26472?\u12290?\u27880?\u-28211?\u20132?\u21449?\u22411?\u20154?\u25165?\u22521?\u20859?\u12290?\cell \trowd\trftsWidth3\trwWidth14609\trrh-740\trgaph10\trpaddl0\trpaddr0\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3\clvmgf\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth14599\cellx14599\row\trowd\trftsWidth3\trwWidth14609\trrh-740\trgaph10\trpaddl0\trpaddr0\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3\clvmrg\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth14599\cellx14599\pard\intbl\cell \trowd\trftsWidth3\trwWidth14609\trrh-740\trgaph10\trpaddl0\trpaddr0\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3\clvmrg\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth14599\cellx14599\row\trowd\trftsWidth3\trwWidth14609\trrh-1340\trgaph10\trpaddl0\trpaddr0\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3\clvmgf\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth14599\cellx14599\pard\plain\intbl\s0\ql\fi0\li0\ri0\plain\f3\fs18\cf0 The professional master's degree of Industrial Design Engineerring (IDE) trains the basic theory and professional knowledge in the field, has the ability to design innovation and practical design engineering application, can undertake professional design, technology or management work with industrial design as the core, and has a good professional quality and Ethical, high-level, application-oriented and compound talents. The master's degree of IDE emphasizes the combination of humanities, social sciences and natural sciences, and serves the engineering fields of modern social industrial design, digital media and product innovation. Use the basic knowledge of industrial design, environmental design, public design, visual and media design, information and interaction design, and information technology to research and solve theoretical and engineering technology application issues related to design, manufacturing, and management in related industries. Focus on cross-type talent training.\cell \trowd\trftsWidth3\trwWidth14609\trrh-1340\trgaph10\trpaddl0\trpaddr0\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3\clvmgf\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth14599\cellx14599\row\trowd\trftsWidth3\trwWidth14609\trrh-1340\trgaph10\trpaddl0\trpaddr0\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3\clvmrg\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth14599\cellx14599\pard\intbl\cell \trowd\trftsWidth3\trwWidth14609\trrh-1340\trgaph10\trpaddl0\trpaddr0\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3\clvmrg\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth14599\cellx14599\row\trowd\trftsWidth3\trwWidth14609\trrh-500\trgaph10\trpaddl0\trpaddr0\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth12441\cellx12441\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth824\cellx13265\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth1334\cellx14599\pard\plain\intbl\s0\ql\fi0\li20\ri0\sl-312\plain\f1\fs26\b\cf0 \u222