\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth14599\cellx14599\row\trowd\trftsWidth3\trwWidth14609\trrh-740\trgaph10\trpaddl0\trpaddr0\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3\clvmrg\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth14599\cellx14599\pard\intbl\cell \trowd\trftsWidth3\trwWidth14609\trrh-740\trgaph10\trpaddl0\trpaddr0\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3\clvmrg\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth14599\cellx14599\row\trowd\trftsWidth3\trwWidth14609\trrh-1340\trgaph10\trpaddl0\trpaddr0\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3\clvmgf\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth14599\cellx14599\pard\plain\intbl\s0\ql\fi0\li0\ri0\plain\f3\fs18\cf0 The training process requires the implementation of the "Shanghai Jiao Tong University Graduate Education Management Regulations" (Shanghai Jiao Tong Graduate School [2019] No. 72) and the "Shanghai Jiao Tong University Regulations on the Training of Master Graduate Students" (Shanghai Jiao Tong Graduate School [2019] No. 96). The training process for master students includes dissertation proposal, mid-term assessment, dissertation peer-review and defense. The dissertation proposal should be applied before the end of the third semester. Those who fail to pass the first dissertation proposal can apply for re-examination next semester. The mid-term assessment should be applied three months before dissertation peer-review, including GPA check, process of the dissertation, personal summaries, mentor evaluation, and assessment panel interview. Dissertation peer-review should be applied 1 month before oral defence.\f0 \par \f3\fs18\cf0 \u160?\cell \trowd\trftsWidth3\trwWidth14609\trrh-1340\trgaph10\trpaddl0\trpadd