 plagirarism, suprevised by mentor, and completed 1 month before defence. The topic of the dissertation\f3\fs18\cf0  \f3\fs18\cf0 must follow design research direction and have both theoretical and practical significance.\f0 \par \f0\fs24\cf0 \par \f0 \par \f3\fs18\cf0 Quality requirements: The format of the dissertation writing shall be implemented in accordance with the relevant regulations of the university. The dissertation requires clear concepts, rich materials, strict logic, profound analysis, and innovative ideas. It should include the design content or artistic creation practice content of relevant research topics, and meet high academic requirements.\cell \trowd\trftsWidth3\trwWidth14609\trrh-1480\trgaph10\trpaddl0\trpaddr0\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth14599\cellx14599\row\pard\plain\sl0\plain\fs2\page\pard\plain\sl0\plain\fs2\par\trowd\trftsWidth3\trwWidth14609\trrh-1480\trgaph10\trpaddl0\trpaddr0\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth14599\cellx14599\pard\plain\intbl\s0\ql\fi0\li0\ri0\plain\f3\fs18\cf0 Normative requirements: The dissertation should meet the requirements of "Shanghai Jiao Tong University Graduate Academic Standards" (Shanghai Jiao Tong Graduate School [2019] No. 87). Dissertation should be independently written with no plagirarism, suprevised by mentor, and completed 1 month before defence. The topic of the dissertation\f3\fs18\cf0  \f3\fs18\cf0 must follow design research direction and have both theoretical and practical significance.\f0 \par \f0\fs24\cf0 \par \f0 \par \f3\fs18\cf0 Quality requirements: The format of the dissertation writing shall be implemented in accordance with the relevant regulations of the university. The dissertation requires c